text Something is rapidly approaching from behind.
text Instead of turning around, my body moves to the side.
text *Swoosh*
text It flies through the area where my head was a moment ago, and digs into the grass.
text It's an encyclopedia (Vol. I)
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text There's only one person who would do something like this...
text @[Tomoya]
text Kyou!
text I turn around as I yell.
text The first thing I see is a Japanese-English dictionary flying toward my face.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ku!
text Since I was in the process of turning around, I start my dodge just a split second late.
text I barely manage to avoid it, but it still scrapes my ear.
text The resulting pain has a frigid feeling to it, telling me how powerful the throw was.
text While I feel shivers run down my spine, I turn around to face my attacker.
