text The first bell rings.
text The students return to the classroom one by one as they chit-chat to prepare for afternoon classes.
text I sit down on my chair while watching.
text Fujibayashi still hasn't returned.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Just where did she go?)
text As far as I know, she always returns to her seat to prepare for the next class when the first bell rings...
text *Clatter*
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm?
text In a somewhat reserved manner, the door opens.
text Shortly thereafter, I see a hand.
text Somebody then slowly starts to peek into the classroom.
